[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2941.109, "timestamp": "00:49:01", "text": "你不会知道这意味着什么，而且你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2943.549, "timestamp": "00:49:03", "text": "会喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2948.23, "timestamp": "00:49:08", "text": "对，没错，正是如此，如果如果有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2950.549, "timestamp": "00:49:10", "text": "有人走过来跟你说，呃，什么什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2954.23, "timestamp": "00:49:14", "text": "那件著名的事是什么？就像想象的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2957.829, "timestamp": "00:49:17", "text": "你在孟买，然后有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2960.47, "timestamp": "00:49:20", "text": "会说马拉地语的人会像我一样攻击你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2961.829, "timestamp": "00:49:21", "text": "你甚至都不知道那是什么意思。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2965.75, "timestamp": "00:49:25", "text": "你会到处说“是啊”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2968.39, "timestamp": "00:49:28", "text": "那简直就是我本人。是的，这就是原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2969.75, "timestamp": "00:49:29", "text": "所以我才告诉你，要学习……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2971.75, "timestamp": "00:49:31", "text": "最好的。这就是为什么人们说“喜欢”的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2973.75, "timestamp": "00:49:33", "text": "为什么人们在学习新知识时会这样做？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2974.199, "timestamp": "00:49:34", "author": "@BreaDGuy0078", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/O8v1G-sabQKoVvPbSD8h_pLVydQ_mLyNSXpDD2A2gNJXBLHO228IzT5zq41iTuqUdmG_2xiIlg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Dats Him fr"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2975.99, "timestamp": "00:49:35", "text": "语言，为什么它们像你知道的那样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2978.95, "timestamp": "00:49:38", "text": "为什么他们总是说“哦，什么？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2980.87, "timestamp": "00:49:40", "text": "先只了解不好的事情。我是说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2983.31, "timestamp": "00:49:43", "text": "你真应该这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2985.549, "timestamp": "00:49:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2988.71, "timestamp": "00:49:48", "text": "真的。这样你就可以避免这种情况了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2990.549, "timestamp": "00:49:50", "text": "是的。所以你可以避免这种情况，然后你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2992.23, "timestamp": "00:49:52", "text": "你也可以避免像你也能知道的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2994.39, "timestamp": "00:49:54", "text": "当别人对你胡说八道时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2996.549, "timestamp": "00:49:56", "text": "那挺好的。我要……我有……我有我的"}]